  "details": "Avatar loading bar is rendered incorrectly in the personal mirror with UI visibility in the mirror enabled and environment disabled.\nIn the video you can see the green loading bar very briefly because the avatars are already in cache. If an avatar loads properly then the loading bar will also change colors between blue and green and be visible for longer time.\nhttps://streamable.com/g3lnoz\nYou need two clients to  reproduce the issue.\n1. Put up a personal mirror with UI visibility and remote players enabled and environment disabled.\n2. Have the second player stand behind the first player and change avatar.\n3. The first player should see the loading bar incorrectly rendered in the mirror.",
